  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "email draft"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hey Faires!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "All the other updates have been made and should now be reflected on the site."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "About the prev/next project links: I know you mentioned wanting to keep navigation within categories, but our recommendation is to keep it global and simply adjust the order of the clips."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Restricting it can make the experience feel a bit closed off—for websites like this, visitors tend to explore based on curiosity, not labels. Categories are great for filtering, but less effective for navigation. A global flow keeps things feeling connected and encourages deeper browsing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you're good with that, just send over the order you'd like the clips to appear in—ideally in a way that reflects how you want to be professionally perceived. That said, we're totally happy to go with the category-based approach if you feel strongly about it!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hey Faires!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "All the other updates have been made and should be reflect on the site."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "About the prev/next project links: I know you mentioned wanting to keep that navigation between clips within categories, but our recommendation is to keep it global and adjust the clip order."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Restricting it can make the experience feel a bit closed off — for websites like this, visitors tend to explore based on curiosity, not labels. Categories are great for filtering but less effective for navigation, so a global flow would keep things feeling connected while encouraging deeper browsing into your works."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you're good with that, just send over the order you'd like the clips to appear in—ideally in a way that reflects how you want to be professionally perceived. That said, we're totally happy to go with the category-based approach if you feel strongly about it!"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}